  {
    "screen": "ramdisk-guardian-unaccounted-watchdog-and-driver-auto-release-04",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "chapter_title",
        "text_ref": "从哪里开始",
        "align": "left",
        "size": "medium"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "在已接通这台电脑的 AI 对话中说“缓存删了但内存没回来，查守护器为什么没有重建”；AI 读本轮条件和恢复状态，自动重建仍只在原任务满足全部门槛时发生。",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "40%"
      },
      {
        "type": "source_text_card",
        "text_ref": "需要准备什么",
        "row": "start",
        "icon_position": "header_left",
        "header_icon": "_library/hires-icons/icon-clean-0432a3e02a060c22b01c.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "从开始到拿到结果",
        "row": "start",
        "width": "60%",
        "heading_icon": "_library/icons/scene-r3-exact-three-stairs.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. **守护器确认证据**　本轮至少 10 秒内连采 3 次并核对 Z 占用；靠“相关增长”触发的，还要相隔至少 5 分钟的两次观察都支持（默认 15 分钟一轮，通常等到下一轮）。条件不足就只记录。",
        "row": "start",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
