  {
    "screen": "ramdisk-guardian-unaccounted-watchdog-and-driver-auto-release-05",
    "orientation": "h",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "section_heading",
        "text_ref": "技术实现与依据（一）",
        "size": "large",
        "heading_icon": "_library/hires-icons/打勾清单.png"
      },
      {
        "type": "prose",
        "text_ref": "现行判断9月29日起生效，源码最后提交10月6日。截止前最后一轮10月11日13"
      },
      {
        "type": "numbered_steps",
        "text_ref": "1. 共同前提是盘已用≤8GiB，然后三条路任一成立才是重建候选：①原始不可归属残差≥8GiB；②相关增长≥8GiB；③可用内存<5GiB 且相关增长≥4GiB。可用内存低单独不动盘。",
        "columns": 1,
        "icons": "none",
        "illustration": "none",
        "connector": "none"
      }
    ]
  },
